      "id": "claim_5a452a2f9ab94733b0a1265417fa871d",
      "statement": "CheckpointTuple packages a checkpoint with its operational context: config (thread_id, checkpoint_ns, checkpoint_id), checkpoint snapshot (channel_values, channel_versions, versions_seen), metadata (source, step, parents), parent_config for ancestry walks, and pending_writes for fault recovery.",
