      "id": "claim_80d6d473b96e44a582a16ac71824aec8",
      "statement": "Thread ID is the primary key isolating execution contexts; reusing the same thread_id accumulates state across invocations while unique IDs yield independent runs. Checkpoint ID (UUID6) uniquely identifies a snapshot and enables time-travel resumption from historical points.",
