      "id": "claim_f768d7b6b0f14a4ea1f391865b2ec2a3",
      "statement": "Delta channels store only incremental deltas between snapshots; naive pruning of intermediate checkpoints breaks reconstruction because delta channels require ancestor checkpoints containing _DeltaSnapshot blobs. Safe pruning requires preserving all ancestors back to the nearest snapshot or forcing fresh snapshots before deletion.",
